Z||000002||Mach10||11-10-2001||04:50 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"> AND YOU'RE DRIVING THIS THING ?!??!??  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"><P>NEVER put different tires left-right on a car!!! I can't believe the alignment shop did that  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P>Pull them off, and move them around so that one brand's on the front, and one's on the rear... That's OK.<p>[This message has been edited by Mach10 (edited 11-10-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000003||artherd||11-10-2001||07:45 PM||||HOLEY **** !<P>Yeah, that's going to be a problem.<P>...<P>NEVER do that!  <P>EEEK!<P><BR>I would strongly recomend *against* running two different tyres front/rear also.  <P>Nothing less than your life rides on the contact patch of your tyres.<P>How much is your life worth to you?<BR> <A HREF="http://www.pirelli.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.pirelli.com</A> <P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/sig1.jpeg">    <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top, Metalic Red           &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>88 Formula, Northstar, Silver                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
